PART OF CANVAS
--------------

The Canvas shell client and its applets.

This repository is one component of the Canvas project. It is developed and
released as part of Canvas, but it lives in its own repository:

    this component   https://github.com/canvas-ui/canvas-shell
    the project      https://github.com/canvas-ui/canvas-server

Canvas components are not all licensed the same way. The server runtime and the
services it embeds are dual-licensed. The standalone clients are AGPL-only. The
COMPONENTS section of the project NOTICE lists which is which.

DISTRIBUTION
------------

This component is a client that runs on the user's own machine, so the network
clause in section 13 of the AGPL is rarely the one that applies to it. Sections
4 to 6 are. If you convey this program, modified or not, through an app store,
an extension gallery, a package registry, a distribution image or an appliance,
recipients must receive this licence and an offer of the corresponding source.

If you build against a modified Canvas server, section 13 still reaches that
server. See the project NOTICE.

